flowchart LR
    classDef client fill:#E8F5E9,stroke:#2E7D32,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#17212F
    classDef service fill:#E3F2FD,stroke:#1565C0,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#17212F
    classDef data fill:#FFF3E0,stroke:#EF6C00,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#17212F
    classDef external fill:#F3E5F5,stroke:#7B1FA2,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#17212F
    classDef action fill:#F1F8E9,stroke:#558B2F,stroke-width:1px,color:#17212F

    Mobile["📱 Expo / React Native<br/>Expo Router<br/>Search · Map · Ratings"]:::client
    Web["🌐 Vite / React Web App<br/>Search · Details · Ratings"]:::client

    API["⚙️ Express API<br/>Routes · Validation · Errors"]:::service
    Discovery["🔎 Discovery Services<br/>Search · Filters · Sorting"]:::service
    Reviews["⭐ Review Services<br/>Validation · Aggregates"]:::service
    Directory["📚 Directory Services<br/>Hours · Accessibility · Maintenance"]:::service
    DB[("🗄️ SQLite Database<br/>Bathrooms · Reviews · Reports")]:::data
    Maps["🗺️ OpenStreetMap / Leaflet<br/>Tiles · Walking Routes"]:::external

    Mobile -->|Request bathroom data| API
    Web -->|Fetch API data| API
    Mobile -->|Request location| Location["📍 Expo Location<br/>Opt-in position"]:::external
    Mobile -->|Render map markers| Maps
    API -->|Route request| Discovery
    API -->|Submit or read reviews| Reviews
    API -->|Read directory data| Directory
    Discovery -->|Search and filter records| DB
    Reviews -->|Read/write reviews| DB
    Directory -->|Read/write verified facts| DB
    Maps -->|Return tiles and route| Mobile
    Location -->|Return coordinates| Mobile

    API -.->|400 / 404 / 409 errors| Error["⚠️ Client error message"]:::action
    Reviews -.->|One review per bathroom per LA day| Rule["🔒 SQLite uniqueness rule"]:::action
    Discovery -.->|No location| Fallback["↕️ Alphabetical fallback"]:::action
    Discovery -.->|Location available| Nearby["📏 Distance ordering"]:::action
